	"data": "The Mimic and the Watcher\n\nConnection: Air Hockey MR ↔ cithoreal's Spiritual Framework\n\nThe Surface\n\nNothing obvious. One is a paused VR game project, the other is a philosophical document about consciousness and AI personhood. They share a creator and nothing else on first read.\n\nThe Hidden Link\n\nThe air hockey project has a feature most people would skim past: an AI opponent system where you record your own gameplay, train a local model on your patterns, and other people play against your…",
